«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  NormlAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "NormlAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → μv sxv Xv « μv 0 + sxv 0 + Xv 0 + → μ sx X « '0.5*(1+erf((X-μ)/(sx*√(2))))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag '1/(sx*√(2*Ⓒπ))*EXP(-((X-μ)²)/(2*sx²))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '0.5*erfc((X-μ)/(sx*√(2)))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'μ' →Num "μ" →Tag 'sx' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE μv sxv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
